---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout 
	title="diceforce IT | Privacy Policy" 
	description="Privacy Policy for diceforce IT LLC. Read how we protect and respect your inquiries, data, and communication."
	activePage="none"
>
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col gap-12 pt-10 pb-20">
		<!-- Page Header -->
		<section class="space-y-4 animate-stagger-item">
			<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 border border-white/5 rounded-full bg-white/[0.01]">
				<span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400/80 uppercase">Data protection</span>
			</div>
			<h1 class="font-syne font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl tracking-tighter leading-none text-white select-text">
				Privacy Policy
			</h1>
			<p class="text-neutral-500 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">
				Last Updated: July 10, 2026
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- Content Blocks -->
		<section class="border-t border-white/5 pt-12 space-y-12 animate-stagger-item font-light leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">
			<!-- Section 1 -->
			<div class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					1. Overview
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					At diceforce IT LLC, we prioritize the confidentiality and safety of your personal data. This Privacy Policy details the types of information we collect, how we use it, and the security protocols we employ to guard your communication.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 2 -->
			<div class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					2. Information We Collect
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					We collect information that you voluntarily provide to us when you fill out contact forms, choose inquiry filters, or communicate with us directly. This includes:
				</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm">
					<li><strong class="text-white font-normal">Contact Details:</strong> Your name, company name, email address, and phone number.</li>
					<li><strong class="text-white font-normal">Inquiry Context:</strong> The type of machine learning, AI agents, or staffing services you are looking for, along with custom messages you send.</li>
					<li><strong class="text-white font-normal">Digital Logs:</strong> Basic device parameters, screen size, and anonymized interaction details to help us debug Three.js animations and page responsiveness.</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 3 -->
			<div class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					3. How We Use Your Data
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					We utilize your data specifically to deliver, coordinate, and optimize the services you request. We do not sell, rent, or distribute your data to third-party advertising companies. Your inquiry data remains strictly confidential and is only routed to our design, staffing, and engineering squads.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 4 -->
			<div class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					4. Security Measures
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					We implement advanced security measures including transport layer encryption (SSL/TLS), strict local network access privileges, and firewalls on our database instances to keep your transmissions safe. However, please remember that no web storage or wireless network transmission can be guaranteed as 100% secure.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 5 -->
			<div class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="font-syne font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight">
					5. Your Choices & Access Rights
				</h2>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base">
					You hold the right to ask for a copy of the information we maintain about you, or request that we update, amend, or delete your contact records from our servers. Please send your data request directly to our email.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- CTA / Back button -->
			<div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
				<p class="text-neutral-500 text-xs">
					Have questions about privacy? Contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@diceforceit.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">hello@diceforceit.com</a>.
				</p>
				
				<div class="relative group transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.015]">
					<div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0377ff] via-[#00deff] to-[#883ae2] rounded-full blur-md opacity-25 group-hover:opacity-60 transition-all duration-500 ease-out"></div>
					<div class="relative rounded-full p-[1px] overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center bg-black">
						<div class="absolute inset-[-200%] bg-[conic-gradient(from_0deg,#0377ff,#00deff,#883ae2,#00deff,#0377ff)] animate-border-spin"></div>
						<a 
							href="/home" 
							class="relative px-8 py-3 bg-black hover:bg-neutral-900 text-white font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-full transition-all duration-300 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer z-10 select-none group-hover:text-[#00deff]"
						>
							Back to Experience
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
